"color:#a3ff33; font-weight:700;\">23%</span>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; color: #a4b3c6; font-size: 0.75rem; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04); padding-top: 0.75rem;\">\n            <span>Jan</span><span>Feb</span><span>Mar</span><span>Apr</span><span>May</span><span>Jun</span>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n[/ux_html]\n\n[/section]\n[section label=\"Page 5 - Desktop\" height=\"100vh\" class=\"section\"]\n\n[ux_html]\n\n<div style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 2rem; box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between; height: 75vh;\">\n    <div style=\"background: rgba(255,255,255,0.01); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 3rem 4rem; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; text-align: left; box-sizing: border-box; width: 100%;\">\n        <div>\n            <h2 style=\"font-size: 2rem; font-weight: 700; color: #ffffff; margin: 0 0 0.5rem 0;\">Ready to unlock the power of AI?</h2>\n            <p style=\"color: #a4b3c6; margin: 0; font-size: 1.05rem;\">Let\'s build intelligent solutions that drive real structural business impact.</p>\n        </div>\n        <a href=\"#\" style=\"background: #a3ff33; color: #112237; padding: 1.2rem 2.5rem; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; font-size: 1rem; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; white-space: nowrap;\">\n            Build with Us <span>???</span>\n        </a>\n    </div>\n\n    <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.51fr repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 2rem; text-align: left; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06); padding-top: 4rem; box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: auto; width: 100%;\">\n        <div style=\"padding-right: 3rem;\">\n            <div style=\"font-size: 1.3rem; font-weight: 800; color: #ffffff; margin-bottom: 1rem; letter-spacing: -0.5px;\">LYCOS CORE</div>\n            <p style=\"color: #a4b3c6; font-size: 0.85rem; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0 0 1.5rem 0;\">Your complete AI strategy and building partner.</p>\n            <div style=\"display: flex; gap: 1rem; font-size: 1.1rem; opacity: 0.6; color: #ffffff;\">\n                <span>????</span><span>????</span><span>????</span><span>????</span>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div>\n            <h4 style=\"color: #ffffff; font-size: 0.9rem; margin: 0 0 1.2rem 0; font-weight: 600;\">Services</h4>\n            <div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.75rem; font-size: 0.85rem; color: #a4b3c6;\">\n                <span>Consulting</span><span>Tech Services</span><span>Product Development</span><span>Integration</span>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div>\n            <h4 style=\"color: #ffffff; font-size: 0.9rem; margin: 0 0 1.2rem 0; font-weight: 600;\">AI Products</h4>\n            <div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.75rem; font-size: 0.85rem; color: #a4b3c6;\">\n                <span>Just genetic productj</span><span>product types</span><span>preduct types)</span><span>Platform Tacls</span>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div>\n            <h4 style=\"color: #ffffff; font-size: 0.9rem; margin: 0 0 1.2rem 0; font-weight: 600;\">Incubation Hub</h4>\n            <div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.75rem; font-size: 0.85rem; color: #a4b3c6;\">\n                <span>Overview</span><span>Partner Companies</span><span>Menter Network</span><span>Apply to Hub</span>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div>\n            <h4 style=\"color: #ffffff; font-size: 0.9rem; margin: 0 0 1.2rem 0; font-weight: 600;\">Resources</h4>\n            <div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.75rem; font-size: 0.85rem; color: #a4b3c6;\">\n                <span>Insights</span><span>Case Studies</span><span>Whitepapers</span><span>Lycos Core</span>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n[/ux_html]\n\n[/section]\n\n<!-- /wp:flatsome/uxbuilder -->','Home','','inherit','closed','closed','','91-revision-v1','','','2026-06-19 08:24:09','2026-06-19 08:24:09','',91,'http://lycos-core.local/?p=392',0,'revision','',0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (393,1,'2026-06-19 08:25:16','2026-06-19 08:25:16','<!-- wp:flatsome/uxbuilder -->\n[row style=\"collapse\" width=\"full-width\" h_align=\"center\"]\n\n[col span__sm=\"12\" align=\"center\"]\n\n[ux_html label=\"Horisontal Scroll implementation\"]\n\n<script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n<script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n\n<div id=\"parallax-bg\"></div>\n\n<div id=\"scroll-wrapper\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: nowrap; width: fit-content; height: 100vh;\"></div>\n\n<script>\nhistory.scrollRestoration = \'manual\';\n\nwindow.addEventListener(\'load\', () => {\n    const sections = document.querySelectorAll(\'.section\');\n    const wrapper = document.getElementById(\'scroll-wrapper\');\n    const bg = document.getElementById(\'parallax-bg\');\n\n    sections.forEach(s => {\n        s.style.width = \'100vw\';\n        s.style.height = \'100vh\';\n        s.style.flexShrink = \'0\';\n        wrapper.appendChild(s);\n    });\n\n    gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n    // Timeline for coordinated movement\n    let tl = gsap.timeline({\n        scrollTrigger: {\n            trigger: \"body\",\n            pin: true,\n            scrub: 1, \n            start: \"top top\",\n            end: () => \"+=\" + (wrapper.scrollWidth - window.innerWidth),\n            snap: {\n                snapTo: 1 / (sections.length - 1),\n                duration: { min: 0.5, max: 0.8 },\n                ease: \"power2.inOut\",\n                delay: 0\n            },\n            invalidateOnRefresh: true\n        }\n    });\n\n    // Move the content\n    tl.to(wrapper, { x: () => -(wrapper.scrollWidth - window.innerWidth), ease: \"none\" }, 0);\n    \n    // Move the background slower (-10% of the movement) for the parallax effect\n    tl.to(bg, { xPercent: -10, ease: \"none\" }, 0);\n\n    setTimeout(() => {\n        window.scrollTo(0, 0);\n        ScrollTrigger.refresh();\n    }, 500);\n});\n</script>\n[/ux_html]\n[ux_html label=\"Menu\"]\n\n<header class=\"lycos-global-fixed-header\">\n    <a href=\"/\" class=\"lycos-nav-identity\">\n        <img src=\"/media/LYCOS-CORE-lOGOTYPE.png\" alt=\"Lycos Core Logo\">\n    </a>\n\n    <nav class=\"lycos-nav-links-box\">\n        <div class=\"nav-dropdown\">\n            <a href=\"#\">Our Pillars</a>\n            <div class=\"dropdown-content\">\n                <a href=\"/ai-consulting/\">AI Consulting</a>\n                <a href=\"/ai-solutions/\">AI Solutions</a>\n                <a href=\"/tech-services/\">Tech Services</a>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <a href=\"/incubation-hub/\">Incubation Hub</a>\n\n        <div class=\"nav-dropdown\">\n            <a href=\"#\">About Us</a>\n            <div class=\"dropdown-content\">\n                <a href=\"/who-we-are/\">Who We Are</a>\n                <a href=\"/how-we-operate/\">How We Operate</a>\n                <a href=\"/governance-and-security-standards/\">Governance & Security Standards</a>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"nav-dropdown\">\n            <a href=\"#\">Insights</a>\n            <div class=\"dropdown-content\">\n                <a href=\"/case-studies/\">Case Studies</a>\n                <a href=\"/executive-briefing/\">Executive Briefing</a>\n                <a href=\"/market-trends/\">Market Trends and Research</a>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <a href=\"/partner-with-us/\">Partner with Us</a>\n        <a href=\"/contact-us/\" class=\"lycos-hero-btn-solid\">Contact Us</a>\n    </nav>\n</header>\n[/ux_html]\n\n[/col]\n\n[/row]\n[section label=\"Page 1 - Desktop\" height=\"100vh\" class=\"section\"]\n\n[row width=\"custom\" custom_width=\"80%\" v_align=\"equal\" h_align=\"right\" padding=\"0px 0px 0px 0px\"]\n\n[col span=\"6\" span__sm=\"12\" align=\"right\"]\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 13px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 3px; color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6); margin-bottom: 15px; font-weight: 600;\">\n    AI That Powers Better Financial Decisions\n</p>\n<h1 style=\"font-size: 58px; font-weight: 800; color: #ffffff; line-height: 1.2; margin-bottom: 35px; letter-spacing: -1px;\">\n    Strategic Intelligence.<br />\n    <span style=\"color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.35); display: block; margin: 5px 0;\">Accelerated Core Building.</span><br />\n    Built for the Future.<br />\n</h1>\n[row_inner]\n\n[col_inner span=\"6\" span__sm=\"12\"]\n\n[button text=\"Explore Services\" size=\"xlarge\" radius=\"10\" class=\"lycos-hero-btn-solid\"]\n\n\n[/col_inner]\n[col_inner span=\"6\" span__sm=\"12\"]\n\n[button text=\"Partner with us\" color=\"success\" style=\"outline\" size=\"xlarge\" radius=\"10\" class=\"lycos-hero-btn-outline\"]\n\n\n[/col_inner]\n\n[/row_inner]\n\n[/col]\n[col span=\"6\" span__sm=\"12\"]\n\n[ux_html]\n\n<div style=\"width: 100%; height: 500px; position: relative;\">\n    <svg id=\"network-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 500 500\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid slice\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; overflow: visible;\">\n        <g id=\"lines\" stroke=\"#a3ff33\" stroke-width=\"0.8\" opacity=\"0.5\"></g>\n        <g id=\"nodes\" fill=\"#00d4ff\"></g>\n        <g id=\"ai-node\" style=\"filter: drop-shadow(0 0 8px rgba(163, 255, 51, 0.5));\">\n            <circle cx=\"250\" cy=\"250\" r=\"45\" fill=\"rgba(17, 34, 55, 0.9)\" stroke=\"#a3ff33\" stroke-width=\"2\" />\n            <text x=\"250\" y=\"258\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#a3ff33\" text-anchor=\"middle\">AI</text>\n        </g>\n    </svg>\n</div>\n[/ux_html]\n\n[/col]\n\n[/row]\n[row]\n\n[col span__sm=\"12\"]\n\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\">Our technology partners</span></h2>\n\n[/col]\n\n[/row]\n[row]\n\n[col span__sm=\"12\"]\n\n\n[/col]\n\n[/row]\n[ux_html]\n\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); align-items: center; justify-items: center; gap: 20px; padding: 20px;\">\n  \n  <div style=\"height: 50px; display: flex; align-items: center;\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/gilbarbara/logos@master/logos/google-cloud.svg\" \n         style=\"height: 100%; width: auto; filter: brightness(0) invert(1);\" alt=\"Google Cloud\">\n  </div>\n       \n  <div style=\"height: 50px; display: flex; align-items: center;\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/gilbarbara/logos@master/logos/aws.svg\" \n         style=\"height: 100%; width: auto; filter: brightness(0) invert(1);\" alt=\"AWS\">\n  </div>\n       \n  <div style=\"height: 50px; display: flex; align-items: center;\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/gilbarbara/logos@master/logos/anthropic-claude.svg\" \n         style=\"height: 100%; width: auto; filter: brightness(0) invert(1);\" alt=\"Claude\">\n  </div>\n</div>\n[/ux_html]\n\n[/section]\n[section label=\"Page 2 - Desktop\" height=\"100vh\" class=\"section\"]\n\n[ux_html]\n\n<div style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 2rem; box-sizing: border-box; text-align: center;\">\n    <h2 style=\"font-size: 2.2rem; font-weight: 700; color: #ffffff; margin-bottom: 3.5rem;\">\n        Our <span style=\"color: #a3ff33;\">pillars</span> for growth.\n    </h2>\n    \n    <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 1.5rem;\">\n        <div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 2.5rem 2rem; text-align: left; transition: border 0.3s; box-sizing: border-box;\">\n            <div style=\"color: #a3ff33; font-size: 2rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\">????</div>\n            <h3 style=\"font-size: 1.3rem; color: #ffffff; margin: 0 0 1rem 0; font-weight: 600;\">Enterprise Consulting</h3>\n            <p style=\"color: #a4b3c6; font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0 0 2rem 0;\">Strategic advisory for AI implementation and techn